# Only the bundle, its icon, and the CLI it drives are needed at runtime. The TypeScript sources are
# in Git; shipping them again in every install helps nobody, and the test fixture is a 42 KB snapshot
# that has no business in a published extension.
src/**
test/**
tsconfig.json
esbuild.mjs
**/*.map
.vscodeignore

# The staged CLI is deliberately NOT ignored: a packaged install has no other way to find an engine.
